name: Ancient Joker — rotating suit X1.5
author: corpus
description: >-
  Ancient Joker gives each played card of a target suit X1.5 Mult when scored; the suit
  changes each round. First-shop X1.5 engine: Smeared Joker makes two suits count as one,
  doubling the chance of matching the target.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: AncientJoker
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Seltzer
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
  - joker: TheTribe
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 20
